1
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:07,500
The Marketplace has ready-made strategies you can add to ActFX.

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:12,230
Open a free strategy, for example EMA Cross.

3
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:15,590
The details show what it does and its price.

4
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:19,810
Click Add to My Strategies.

5
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:25,940
A copy is saved to your account. The card now says Added.

6
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:31,350
The star keeps a strategy in your Favourites.

7
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:44,350
Favourites shows the starred ones.

8
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:49,270
In ActFX, your copy is under My Strategies, ready to run, test or change.

9
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:53,280
Right-click and choose Make a Copy to keep a second version to experiment with.

10
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,280
The new copy appears in the list.

